  "description": "After introducing <a href=\"#kim2021donut\">Donut</a>, we build Cream🍦 which leverages large language models (LLMs).\n               To mitigate the gap between vision encoders and LMs, we propose auxiliary encoders and contrastive learning scheme. \n               Cream demonstrates robust and impressive document understanding performance."
